yFQXAccoxZD_i3dYSiO6IGrqkcpzm0DKxQh__mktBniuw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfynRRQYlfF70XOlcAK6Qh20a9tdQWJe0zZMV3OgHIjpQw&oe=69B020D5"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_03.png", "id": "1078013840882615", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499356638_1078013844215948_4431526408350712785_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4YaanuAf3JQQ7kNvwG3X9qA&_nc_oc=AdnXz6rkLaCbM3VP9vRE4TCYjd_mh77XnVLZr6Ys5ztCMfSmusDk267EpE4mfAbUEqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxtDfmhwepQWdjNzzRW_2ecECFmSCYgpp99b8pfNX_K_Q&oe=69B0118E"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_01.png", "id": "548187144806946", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499324048_548187148140279_302708763491369627_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_awJPaypFD8Q7kNvwEKtCyu&_nc_oc=AdnfHD9uERy4sMA6U-Yy161LdQ_N8TfWrllrtH1UgKU2M9F_bS946WQvEKLtEghrAtg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwmD21km8KKK84Mw7h26tSc0f9UJ66zDmo_IXRs7scy-A&oe=69B011F4"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_05.png", "id": "1416446512843773", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499324939_1416446516177106_7952489805788314366_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CMRwpYwgJR0Q7kNvwHOMrks&_nc_oc=AdlV3iUhTF6KmkdPg1juArvDmtpFaFlhNcNlE7H3wo_nKTdfctVYRTq8YTuIKAeWQ80&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfySk_Jz_QhCE3PdyEtueINLosCf6L8o4beM8aOAHS3lfQ&oe=69AFF63A"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_06.png", "id": "1188825093024789", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499333143_1188825096358122_7698089225442683365_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q1YW-kGeM0IQ7kNvwENmLq-&_nc_oc=AdnOeG0Zwx8eEhS1xKMU03pO53BcKn5h64VxEpUIrv6hc629tKn-CR2Pxkq3csl6arM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxecKrcRpY4jIXb-hEGRA13alQL8cvzQbEMIM9waApcBw&oe=69B00E51"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "V8 Engine Simulation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock the mysteries of automotive engineering with our cutting-edge V8 Engine Training Simulator. Immerse yourself in a virtual world where learning meets hands-on experience, allowing enthusiasts, students, and professionals to grasp the intricacies of V8 engine assembly like never before.\n\nPowered by state-of-the-art technology, our simulator utilises a real V8 engine model, providing an authentic and comprehensive learning experience. Whether you're a novice eager to explore the mechanics or a seasoned automotive enthusiast aiming to enhance your knowledge, our simulator caters to all skill levels.\n\nKey Features:\n\n1. Real Engine Integration: Our simulator boasts a genuine V8 engine, enabling users to interact with real components and understand their functions.\n\n2. Interactive Learning Modules: Dive into an array of interactive modules that cover every aspect of V8 engine assembly, from identifying parts to mastering the intricacies of fuel injection systems.\n\n3. Real-Time Feedback: Receive instant feedback on your assembly progress, allowing for continuous improvement and a deeper understanding of the engine's inner workings.\n\n4. Step-by-Step Tutorials: Guided by detailed step-by-step tutorials, users can progress at their own pace, ensuring a thorough grasp of each assembly stage.\n\n\n\n\nUnleash your passion for engines and master the art of V8 assembly like never before!\n", "short_description": "Discover the art of V8 engine assembly with our state-of-the-art Training Simulator! Featuring a real V8 engine, interactive modules, and step-by-step tutorials, our simulator caters to all skill levels. Gain hands-on experience, receive real-time feedback, and master the intricacies of automotive engineering. Elevate your knowledge with our immersive and authentic V8 Engine Training Simulator today! \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pastelcube.com/privacy-pol